reconstructed the helper protocol (contracts/helper-protocol-delta.md "Frames", research D-2, D-10) as ClientHelper writes it for op=nodeConfig and research.md "Spike findings" (T018, 8.1.17), request names=OperationMode,ClusterBindAddress,NodeName.
Both forms of a property the node does not have: OperationMode in the error form T018 saw on 8.1.17 (config <name> error com.inubit.ibis.utils.InubitException wrapping Cannot invoke "Object.getClass()" because "o" is null); ClusterBindAddress as config <name> absent, the null answer the protocol allows, never seen in T018 and written from the protocol only; NodeName answers. Not recorded: written by hand with the fixed nonce of the 020/021 fixtures and the two log4j lines of fixtures/server-log/v8_1/webservice/ok.frames; all names and values are fictitious (node1), the display names, categories and descriptions are invented.
